This product is derived from PySpectrometer2 by Les Wright
(https://github.com/leswright1977/PySpectrometer2), which is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The proven scientific behavior of the original has been preserved and is
enforced by regression ("golden") tests, but the implementation has been
substantially rewritten. The original source is retained unmodified under
Original_Pyspectrometer2/ (git tag: baseline-v1.0) for reference and
regression testing.

